{"id":"n74302-1-8","stage":5,"title":"전념 · 专心","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74302-1-8-1","ko":"이번 경기를 마지막으로 은퇴를 하신다고요?","zh":"这次比赛之后您就要退役了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"경기를","meaning":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","explanation":"경기：竞技，比赛，竞赛；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60094","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마지막으로","meaning":"最后，最终，末了","explanation":"마지막：最后，最终，末了；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"마지막","audio":"/audio/8da62ef6312ba9ce3e2e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28843","senseId":"1","lemma":"마지막","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"은퇴를","meaning":"隐退，退役，退休","explanation":"은퇴：隐退，退役，退休；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"은퇴","audio":"/audio/fc798874df76f2d413c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71191","senseId":"1","lemma":"은퇴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하신다고요?","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ다고요：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"e56314e9a18b80c1","term":"경기","zh":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3","entryId":"60094","definition":"互相比较运动或技术等的能力。","pronunciation":["경ː기"]},{"id":"8da62ef6312ba9ce","term":"마지막","zh":"最后，最终，末了","audio":"/audio/8da62ef6312ba9ce3e2e.mp3","entryId":"28843","definition":"在时间上或次序上的末尾。","pronunciation":["마지막"]},{"id":"fc798874df76f2d4","term":"은퇴","zh":"隐退，退役，退休","audio":"/audio/fc798874df76f2d413c9.mp3","entryId":"71191","definition":"从原本做的工作中退下来或不再从事社会活动而悠闲地生活。","pronunciation":["은퇴","은퉤"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"从事，经营","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"拥有某种职业或运营某种事业。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5548eb5d71a2da8f4556.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74302-1-8-2","ko":"네, 저는 지금까지 선수 생활에 전념을 다했기에 후회는 없습니다.","zh":"是的，我一直以来都全身心投入运动员生涯，所以并不后悔。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지금까지","meaning":"现在，当前，眼下","explanation":"지금：现在，当前，眼下；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"2","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"선수","meaning":"选手，运动员","explanation":"선수：选手，运动员","readings":[{"term":"선수","audio":"/audio/c4df0bdce9d53b7cc97a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62050","senseId":"1","lemma":"선수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생활에","meaning":"生活","explanation":"생활：生活；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"생활","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74183","senseId":"3","lemma":"생활","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전념을","meaning":"专心，专注","explanation":"전념：专心，专注；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"전념","audio":"/audio/e8dd3c7c256881263181.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74302","senseId":"1","lemma":"전념","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다했기에","meaning":"竭尽，尽到","explanation":"다하다：竭尽，尽到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；기에：说明作为判断或行动根据的原因：“因为、鉴于”。","readings":[{"term":"다하다","audio":"/audio/238dc042d00a64bf08fc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61526","senseId":"4","lemma":"다하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"후회는","meaning":"后悔","explanation":"후회：后悔；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"후회","audio":"/audio/a146bc1db8a47a35e28a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89266","senseId":"1","lemma":"후회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없습니다.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在，当前，眼下","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"不是过去也不是未来，而是当今。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"c4df0bdce9d53b7c","term":"선수","zh":"选手，运动员","audio":"/audio/c4df0bdce9d53b7cc97a.mp3","entryId":"62050","definition":"体育比赛中被选为代表的人；或指以运动为职业的人。","pronunciation":["선ː수"]},{"id":"6a739e74f8dfb7fb","term":"생활","zh":"生活","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3","entryId":"74183","definition":"作为某组织的一员进行活动。","pronunciation":["생활"]},{"id":"e8dd3c7c25688126","term":"전념","zh":"专心，专注","audio":"/audio/e8dd3c7c256881263181.mp3","entryId":"74302","definition":"心思只用在一件事上。","pronunciation":["전념"]},{"id":"238dc042d00a64bf","term":"다하다","zh":"竭尽，尽到","audio":"/audio/238dc042d00a64bf08fc.mp3","entryId":"61526","definition":"为做某事而用上了全心全力。","pronunciation":["다ː하다"]},{"id":"a146bc1db8a47a35","term":"후회","zh":"后悔","audio":"/audio/a146bc1db8a47a35e28a.mp3","entryId":"89266","definition":"认识到自己以前做的错事，并对犯下的错误进行自我批评。","pronunciation":["후ː회","후ː훼"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a2ae3f0da294cd393f3a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.033,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74302","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":174,"sequenceScore":3.5097,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这次比赛之后您就要退役了吗？","是的，我一直以来都全身心投入运动员生涯，所以并不后悔。","妈妈，我最近腰疼得厉害。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这次比赛之后您就要退役了吗？","是的，我一直以来都全身心投入运动员生涯，所以并不后悔。","妈妈，我最近腰疼得厉害。"],"answer":1}]}
